error[E4001]: use of moved value `f`
  --> tests/moves/fail/E4001_linear_after_destructure.tarn:14:10
   |
13 |  match f { Frame{addr} => print(addr) }
   |            ----------- value moved here
14 |  consume(f)
   |          ^ value used here after move
   |
   = note: `Frame` is not a copy type, so assigning or passing it moves it
   = help: to keep using `f`, borrow it where it is moved (`&f`) instead of moving it

